{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:aabc53374a4ccff65331aa8810e8493a916e81ea59e99daa6a6be377fc752405",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53cbcd1415aa4d8decde431d33c82d3af5614fe226298af2f2bd833a3586fea5",
      "text": "赌上清扫屋的尊严",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5af59084cc5da00e3d9f275dca126062a745d1af6d3a5af5b512cbb61f032a33",
      "text": "制作人对偶然相遇的雨彦感受到了作为偶像的魅力。另一方面，雨彦却察觉到了在演艺圈这个世界中蔓延的“污垢”。在苦思该如何清扫的对策中，他回忆起了与亡父的对话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53cbcd1415aa4d8decde431d33c82d3af5614fe226298af2f2bd833a3586fea5",
      "text": "赌上清扫屋的尊严",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d1f9c86f54acbe107acf58915a741441dcb15481419d4ca54fa9040cd0dea7a",
      "text": "……嘛，既然事情办完了那就再好不过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6962e4eae09289a913149fba5601ca01fbbcdf02151ca7df0d3dc0179d4bd168",
      "text": "趁早离开这里吧。\n可别再在这大街上晕倒了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0415692767fc633288a6db56f407752d747c43dc9980c8c3303a61bcabfdd1a0",
      "text": "好、好的，我会小心的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9831f09fdeacae341115fd5cd762852eb5facedfa60d5f548e4fa9f84dddcfa",
      "text": "（是在这栋楼里工作的吗？\n真是位带着奇妙氛围的男性啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:789f8bf22964bde7ba6c8dd3b17dd7fd7a07bea444239f08088d6bae3a4646b8",
      "text": "（如果有这么强烈的吸引力，\n作为偶像肯定也会大放光彩的……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:860c67b9ac2b72a6a23f2b7eedac2b156eef9b6ea18d2c1a1630a674436d10a1",
      "text": "冒昧打扰真不好意思。\n可以的话，能请您收下这个吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_a:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f928923f4409f471d4dcad6670914179896bd7e5143f8e7fe1f90098439b7e3",
      "text": "……“315 Production”？\n啊，刚才说的偶像事务所啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_a:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9b818b1b60bfdab5364847ca3b2e8753185e27cc43695e42d83364b69190e50",
      "text": "是的。请问您对偶像的工作有兴趣吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_a:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:796a7a888e8e9a7bcba202c87d290d6ebff1e2323d509d3624ddfd5a1423c2a9",
      "text": "我们近期要举办试镜。\n如果有兴趣的话，请务必来参加！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d8cc5e1589fc5f4187cf6355078a4ccd589e9cc8ccfea3926bb11a3bb67ea5c",
      "text": "（原来如此。以发掘为目的，\n才来这栋大楼的啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ead738f0b8330796ddb0f930075dfb43625db423242611745de4a0ba2702c06a",
      "text": "（不过啊，这位。\n“那个东西”还是别带回去为好哦）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df9f4a9fd7055909c250b5454d6dfd2406696acaa64ac3b7187daeaab9e8466b",
      "text": "啊，多谢了。要是有兴趣的话吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18600640e4c96261f22d921fe2658b04df8203e3a7fca3fda080bedf7af2324f",
      "text": "（……嗯，这下变干净了吧。\n过一会儿，身体状况应该就会好转了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a495984e887e41f41d383fac4f8f51d0fb9bbad192d0fa2610e6a7a8470490b",
      "text": "（……看来这次的现场，\n要比预想中花更多时间了啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_b:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e61328d616a1d306399e27a9cfc2a109b5fe608155ea24fe44743796fd2eb10",
      "text": "我接下来要回去工作了，\n你也路上小心回去吧。再见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67bac44fb4c650a64c9fda3320f60ad56b7f9d7cb9acf4da9cd53d46a7634c26",
      "text": "谢谢您。\n期待您的联系！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58049bd1578fd1e8f22db23869e63496a57c18cbea5431743bee595394dd7b4a",
      "text": "（仔细一看，名牌上写着“AYAKASHI清扫社”。\n是来这栋楼做保洁的清扫员先生吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3b261072a4afb04bd432de0a95ffc606a55c271a4b05b4ca450d2e32990ec5a",
      "text": "（虽然没能聊上太多，\n但要是能来参加试镜的话……嗯？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d79bf8cce7a11a2999c4add97f6a3fc2886d9f8ae9ce89d23100a411c52674e3",
      "text": "头晕的感觉消失了。\n不知为何，身体好像也变轻了……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_c:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ef8ebcf7ecfc00de74446ecc0dbfe35e5ee788fec126918c77ac5c3a3a606fa",
      "text": "电视台",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_c:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71ba3ceaf18f8d41e1ca27eb6d4e262a4b687e52be12be4b22a5efbbd1f6628c",
      "text": "真是的。我们节目用的那个艺人，\n通告费那么高收视率却带不动。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_c:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b498100e6641fabec1872ea9d2a6d76d6c695fd37dfe187b4566b83a49eb52ac",
      "text": "是不是还没察觉到自己已经在走下坡路了啊。\n说起来，前阵子也是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:89e44a1e10197af68a123e10ccd27dac97d1cdcb0c54918e705d92ecf1d08377",
      "text": "（……煽动吧煽动吧。比起真相，\n越过激收视率才越高啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efc42b70093628f1ab18dea257682fcedb568e842c0347825c08b4ae444e5b61",
      "text": "（凭什么选那孩子不选我？\n明明除了长相一无是处，水平那么低！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47b5677c904788be05d2f376119b27939fea6393a8ebd1d3b9fe5de6b83badf4",
      "text": "哎呀呀。污垢积攒得相当多啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4df720e754e4491bab08625f1171d0ea74ba4339a90fcd8b6d56448ebcc679a2",
      "text": "（要是带着这里的污垢的人，\n像刚才那样在外面到处走动的话……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c2b3819fe4608f6c1fecbe8bd13a679c4f280e4f888af638678273159284531",
      "text": "（可就不止局限于这栋楼，\n连这一带都会受到影响了吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_c:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d45f16584ae366ca7ef5911222902f7451f25b256832d9da30de13dc8b524229",
      "text": "这可真是，让人有打扫的干劲了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_d:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fe235f415b1dee17a6b71163dd2c7a21cb6221cea77501220edbd81a4337e13",
      "text": "5年前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_d:cmd-000024:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99ae303ec6fdb14b872b2768bc821262b49b6cafe7130d8766a5dd411dcd77d7",
      "text": "葛之叶宅邸",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e5285f77deb251bebc6e567a3282521fc403deaea390e6deda188d026ff49c9",
      "text": "老爹，这次委托人送来的慰问品。\n说是给我们的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_d:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e3ed138ff5ec5de66ea01e5b9cf2bb9b9e5b9607affe0e24d524ca23c45d923f",
      "text": "噢，那可太感谢了。\n等会儿拿这个稍微喝一杯怎么样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18c8379780349e4cbab52a9811e6b4ef779dece73e9c2eb346d80a88d31d46a4",
      "text": "大白天的？\n挺好啊，我去准备。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4becf8cc4c02cb10d5f65dacda2a97da0b9f29dbbd5347931b8dbe5b386e279",
      "text": "雨彦，工作怎么样了？最近也开始\n负责大型现场了，挺不容易的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_d:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e64ef7d1d11efdcecb12d6cd14a34e194ea7d289fd93cb8581fe049ee58a5ac",
      "text": "嗯，一开始手忙脚乱的，\n现在手法已经熟练多了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_d:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7c2f62a832afec8e89eb3620818bb551b92605459f2039c38a5b306f6426d596",
      "text": "要是遇到什么事，老爹这位前辈\n也会立刻出手帮忙嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0ca87e5b515ebaaa2e8cbb3a2aaddd80b4cb56dde94ee973a7a48a2702b08fe",
      "text": "你做事很麻利，成长得也快……不过，\n你所拥有的力量，可不止这些吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_d:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c41c52244fa22c389ce344018348a34f9866a27a09c2efe13c5861835cccb53b",
      "text": "雨彦。在今天的现场，你看到了什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78be2494823c828cc358f1862e394a16125e7258fdc89ac1b0f7e01b2eda3b96",
      "text": "……没什么。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:529081c01cee2082c8c4bee05fd9fcd8fedf3999cbcf475f44b8186837fa6a42",
      "text": "没必要隐瞒。\n你的眼力有多好，老祖母也是认可的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:06a1be513d162ebaa0fdf8c51347ccbc9b7ebe503461da723fd31b356e5de1c1",
      "text": "但是……看透一切、\n守护葛之叶之名与血脉的是女人们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58e2006f84018a276d4e5c74aff27d40b515728c2199526910f707cbf7692838",
      "text": "母亲之后，迟早由你妹妹来继承这个家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:38430db2da2b59649753f248a484b3569b403db59685a8fe4f624c543371be09",
      "text": "我们这些男人们的工作……是清扫。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b0bce12506200d77cf0a669cfece54d270206cfb1aa129b3da60be17045a0b9",
      "text": "雨彦。用那份力量，今后也\n好好辅佐母亲她们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3838b2dd172c46e65e5b6102ede5b14b591de319ec312e8c963825155baec6ae",
      "text": "……啊。交给我吧，老爹。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b715071ac0334075be61604ba432776caf7f0b0b62a77aad56703d66fd8b6e9f",
      "text": "老妈作为葛之叶的当家，\n老爹作为男丁全心全意地辅佐着她。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84066deabbb6bfbc145e2fe6fe9cd4622e188883909ce509bf9d51f3a949a3a9",
      "text": "对自己的职责抱有自豪，\n作为清扫屋努力工作的你的身姿……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc69a8d6095d7dfca5060e27df21ca7b37918abca12b9bf4a5d2825d28884fef",
      "text": "一直以来，都是我的目标。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_f:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7d40e0f4a49f92eb0797594fc3ea83fa9e8b7e52fa7ea380e69c3868e328bc1",
      "text": "那时的对话，你还记得吗。老爹。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_f:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29421af707827e1348e748870cf61c467a744b19d02d802718735cc6f1f30a0e",
      "text": "（在那之后不久，老爹就在\n工作中的一起事故里丧命了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_f:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfa904e1b26c887bb992d6f4e0d1b92c0974497f09b40341230eb350c87e8617",
      "text": "（事故的原因，至今仍不明朗）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4288ec3fe2e3a4ea6d059c9f1ed168b512fa6b1fdcf31903149cc4a95f2efca9",
      "text": "（即使以我的双眼去看，也没能查明真相。\n……恐怕今后，也不会水落石出了吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a2d5ca3a5060bdc3ee77b19e54f5768d32b0ea7e654099177c221bd095520ad",
      "text": "（既然如此……我只要，做好我能做的事就行了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_f:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:373cf5b326058a42613c4d871231d39dcc5a696cca2c3dab109655a610387e9f",
      "text": "“我们这些男人们的工作是……”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_f:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:496358e98eeb2b568ece6753f3f9c50c14999dd2c75bc2a1db25644c1c234cf1",
      "text": "……是啊，老爹。我是清扫屋。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_f:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b34c87935f4a3ec9ca62bb47ca431b76107796a2accbae497a582def1fc07a5b",
      "text": "我今后也只要，\n以你的背影为目标就行了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_g:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a59b585f18077dae35f5b81c8a49f04dd1b23d252d871f4212f23115201929f5",
      "text": "老妈，能打扰一下吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_g:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b567f81319726848af3a82376ad226cdcba13fed85658a81f322284e9922cd7",
      "text": "老爹的葬礼才刚办完，真是不好意思。\n我有件要紧事想找您商量。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd0281ac412a9062d45fdedc1f11bc1aea8fdb6498b6d931394927cde762bb26",
      "text": "我想以此为契机离开这个家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_g:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4954e4049afb556b943ceb96d3beaf651c5416e5a96471fe23b0e5000211ce93",
      "text": "姑姑管辖的东京分店，还在吧。\n希望能让我调动到那边去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_g:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:164ae4f2ce869b6d4af6aeb9ab72a6ae98b80f54f082552fce39cd06898c5bc6",
      "text": "工作的事情已经被老爹狠狠锤炼过了，\n差不多也是自立门户的好时机了吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_g:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ae3028778b39c9441b548341f8856ccc64040e51c3bb44872f41d5235c05c9c",
      "text": "……老祖母对我的评价，我也知道。\n说什么“虽为男儿身却有当家的潜质”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a212b4e594e0128d6a0fdd829a52f07803407aa0e4134ba8e3b278245e3ca737",
      "text": "不过，那些事情就交给妹妹吧。\n我想作为清扫屋，来支撑起这个家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16d0d94f4d34950ba497fc2770b487d108edb448d132b8acdf88f10cdf7f3064",
      "text": "正如老爹，当年那样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_h:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ac33fe775bfcff9531e343278a840fc64288b980001e907c58a7aff78497c06",
      "text": "休息室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_h:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fc156172d1c10eaf3badab460c045169b7f79734321af2ad4927e4e5da88aa5",
      "text": "呼，稍微变干净了点吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_h:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:20fb8e88772bc166a0c1ea04f85b308f40450dd0260ca5baee77ecdff288da30",
      "text": "（这样一来，暂时能维持一阵子，不过……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_h:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b95870dc4fa37f5d81200c3a2f790949d79fb1e34b55159a209b821a08447030",
      "text": "不，所以说啊……长得好看的话，\n唱功根本不需要在意啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba97a6be28cf7c5a60c5525f818ec84277b328727b92bb1588f84059c237ccc5",
      "text": "（反正假唱观众也看不出来。\n真是的，业务能力真差劲的下属啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_h:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6240e83b66df0f2df70706a19b3fabca0b6c66c7af9596786ece84f3824580e6",
      "text": "刚才导演给我的指示，跟上周给我的指示\n完全相反啊。这难道不奇怪吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_h:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13f9cc8d187a6cb2efed8d05a09884801a5761438b5ffef371ad6355de520d25",
      "text": "（哈哈。明明是随口撒的谎，工作人员却当真犯愁了。\n为了换换心情，干脆再多整整他们吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_h:cmd-000086:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8cfb37fc4aafc49e53fb5c1c0e27fd4fe411f5466cbdd028f41dd37aed0f487c",
      "text": "（哎呀……坏空气又充满这里了啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_h:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8db4b0e2c006357aad37dcdcdc50d7beb12c45a5b326c263a662b02a5bf49c23",
      "text": "……看来演艺圈这地方，\n可不是个能轻易对付的世界啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_h:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f294226296d06f85e49b5fafac685936b9c16844ceca7b4b0a8f8dd76e46759",
      "text": "（愤怒、憎恨、嫉妒……人们的思绪\n接二连三地喷涌而出，让空气变得浑浊不堪）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_h:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7789388dc04583bffd1150d6c28f98b987360e473b3ab83ce5e129d672967f0f",
      "text": "（看这情况，可不是光把这栋楼打扫干净\n就能解决的啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_h:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afcd57a3e9f3244eddc0f2546bfbc1a04566c07fc82964abcd5848b95c7a1b0a",
      "text": "那么，该怎么办才好呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_i:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b10b93efd81b6b923fe8e98281f50e367e064f99bc45c2ce2e431171728def45",
      "text": "……嗯？这是……啊。\n刚才的名片啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_i:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c0317ed66f7ca276b00a030048f9e5db37352a0433c57d11ba0627fbf52d5a1",
      "text": "（“315 Production”……\n真没想到居然会有人来邀请我）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_i:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9b818b1b60bfdab5364847ca3b2e8753185e27cc43695e42d83364b69190e50",
      "text": "是的。请问您对偶像的工作有兴趣吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_i:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:796a7a888e8e9a7bcba202c87d290d6ebff1e2323d509d3624ddfd5a1423c2a9",
      "text": "我们近期要举办试镜。\n如果有兴趣的话，请务必来参加！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e87b21806dab2ca1c3fe0e98b2512d22026ff264b5b25e3247b4a0ca5072f29a",
      "text": "偶像，是吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07ed8375c925bdc98d653258220072b4361fcde54fe4ec5a954970a1a58b0391",
      "text": "（要是我的话，真有那种前途的话。\n作为偶像闯入这个世界，好像也不错？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_i:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a0c273ce8f301096dde24a1fe04ade363b4bff03bde0923b5adb8d4bc6ffd3fd",
      "text": "（成为偶像的话，就能出入\n演艺圈各种各样的现场了吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55da880ca8b56f685da3d4d3db818d3b7a81a7910b72be38cb7940809b02c400",
      "text": "毕竟既然发现了污垢，\n可就不能坐视不管了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_i:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afdb7cba3e7f50429ae2a1f8e1f1cd5b268d94f039540e33f5c9f942087540cc",
      "text": "这张名片……\n对清扫来说，说不定是条不错的捷径呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_j:cmd-000023:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_j:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5de786312197a06afaf8ad972f20708aa5f2aed45dcf5593936b396281702ce",
      "text": "您好！\n请在这边办理登记。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68de35647c8d87eb98ab4cf2e0ed4b65372f815d62e39231ea46a3f97a5234a3",
      "text": "是北村想乐先生，对吧。\n那么，请去那边稍候。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_j:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ae4d6f4e30951a7cf1ad9031034f9dfcc1939e32aaba7807a1d017f87d09664",
      "text": "请多指教～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_j:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53b9d45c2d0be8c5da8421fa70c27f180d7aa50939eea4273d9dd9d210e7fe81",
      "text": "下一位，请进！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_j:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3677701f82850e244630f90ea0e3b45ef3611a184778d790d238ac68d310f23b",
      "text": "好的，请多指教。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_j:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37ded80bb044e8274e6d232147c9b1af710a48406c5e1a60d42e6ba4b8846bb9",
      "text": "（那位就是北村想乐先生啊……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_j:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3af121927ab64597d12ce79bf8a8c6da42d0936fbbf9dec86b925595a4067381",
      "text": "（看报名材料时就有所感觉了，\n果然很有作为偶像的魅力！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_j:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8f2910a67859d218d5338895312bf8b7e31cf9b84620cb6e76c918a5644cfcbf",
      "text": "（而且，在大学遇到的古论克里斯先生也在！\n能来参加试镜真是太好了。但是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_j:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd2846f28a1e3f9dca354c532b5a9eabc025724cff8e77a46bb3bc87201d896b",
      "text": "（在电视台遇到的那位男性，\n今天好像也没来……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_015leg_03_1_1_015_03:1_1_015_03_j:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37a6e55a5c65fd62fad5ee37c5cd23fb53dea0a16a7573d7347ad72523f89730",
      "text": "今天的参加者好像都到齐了呢。\n那么，试镜现在开始！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
